{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "哪怕是备用方案  (Even as Plan B)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu storms into the producer's office. She feels she has been tricked into wasting her time on a backup guest.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这些笔迹，是我跟李铭基那边沟通的所有的细节的记录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "包括每次被挂断的电话，被问到的所有的问题，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还有李铭基提的所有的要求，我都一笔一画地写到上面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我就想问问，我付出的这些时间，真的会有价值吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "哪怕是作为备用方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实每次要请什么艺人，问问粉团科技的吉秀不就好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "何必每次假装让底层的小员工做方案呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就算再底层、再小的员工，也不愿意为此浪费自己的生命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "滚出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "误会，误会，误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "刚才是杏子打电话过来，说辛惠美同意来参加半决赛，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "客座导师。当然因为演出还被雪藏，总决赛来不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以第一方案还是李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用滚了，慢慢走着去吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这些笔迹，是我跟李铭基那边沟通的所有的细节的记录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These notes are a record of all the details I communicated with Li Mingji.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "包括每次被挂断的电话，被问到的所有的问题，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Including every phone call that was hung up, and all the questions asked.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还有李铭基提的所有的要求，我都一笔一画地写到上面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And all the demands Li Mingji made, I wrote them all down stroke by stroke.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我就想问问，我付出的这些时间，真的会有价值吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just want to ask, will this time I put in really have value?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "哪怕是作为备用方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if just as a backup plan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实每次要请什么艺人，问问粉团科技的吉秀不就好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, every time you want to invite an artist, wouldn't it be fine just to ask Ji Xiu from Fentuan Tech?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "何必每次假装让底层的小员工做方案呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why pretend to let lowly small employees make proposals every time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就算再底层、再小的员工，也不愿意为此浪费自己的生命。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even the lowest, smallest employee would not be willing to waste their life for this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "滚出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "误会，误会，误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Misunderstanding, misunderstanding, misunderstanding.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "刚才是杏子打电话过来，说辛惠美同意来参加半决赛，",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi just called to say that Xin Huimei agreed to participate in the semifinal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "客座导师。当然因为演出还被雪藏，总决赛来不了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As guest mentor. Of course, because her performances are still frozen, she cannot come to the finals.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以第一方案还是李铭基。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the first plan is still Li Mingji.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用滚了，慢慢走着去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to roll out, you can walk slowly.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这些笔迹，是我跟李铭基那边沟通的所有的细节的记录。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "包括每次被挂断的电话，被问到的所有的问题，",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "还有李铭基提的所有的要求，我都一笔一画地写到上面。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我就想问问，我付出的这些时间，真的会有价值吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "哪怕是作为备用方案。",
      "gap": 0.5
